{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17408","headline":"德宗神武孝文皇帝挽歌词三首 二 · 权德舆","name":"德宗神武孝文皇帝挽歌词三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梯航来万国，玉帛庆三朝。\n湛露恩方浃，薰风曲正调。\n晏车悲卤簿，广乐遏箫韶。\n最怆号弓处，龙髯上紫霄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}